<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Canal +.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Canal +.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Product (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 1.50 million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on Canal Plus, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	  STRIKE	    ISS PRICE	MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A	    1200.00 FRF     18.44 FRF	26.MAY.98</p>
<p> CALL B	    1320.00 FRF     16.22 FRF	26.NOV.98</p>
<p> CALL C	    1320.00 FRF     22.07 FRF	26.NOV.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE	06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
